03:47:33,102 --> 03:47:33,382
and

2964
03:47:34,302 --> 03:47:34,642
start

2965
03:47:36,062 --> 03:47:39,742
creating these codes and maybe run a server also for

2966
03:47:39,802 --> 03:47:40,062
